## [Deep Watch](deep_watch)
---
crew
Race: terran
---
The quiet late shift - a skeleton watch, long past anything scheduled. Fewer names than
there are stations, on purpose: consoles nobody covers read as unmanned, which is the point
of a skeleton watch.

### [Halden Rooke](rooke)
---
Rank: Lieutenant
Console: helm
---

### [Yusra Al-Amin](alamin)
---
Rank: Ensign
Console: science
---

### [Dmitri Sarkisian](sarkisian)
---
Rank: Ensign
Console: engineering
---

